<title>USA: HUBCO Inc in $50 mln preferred offering.</title>
<headline>HUBCO Inc in $50 mln preferred offering.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAY, N.J. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>HUBCO Inc said on Tuesday it set an offering of 8.98 percent capital securities, raising $50 million for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The securities pay interest semi-annually, on February 1 and August 1, and HUBCO has the option of deferring interest for up to five years.</p>
<p>The placement is underwritten by Keefe, Bruyette &amp; Woods Inc, Josephthal Lyon &amp; Ross Inc, Tucker Anthony Inc and Ryan Beck &amp; Co.</p>
</text>
